# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OmniTrip — environment variable reference
# Copy to .env and fill in your values. Never commit .env.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Create a project at https://supabase.com → Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...

# ── LLM keys (SERVER-SIDE ONLY — Supabase edge function secrets) ──────────────
# These are NEVER set as VITE_ or EXPO_PUBLIC_ variables.
# All LLM calls route through the llm-proxy edge function which holds these keys.
#
# Set them once with the Supabase CLI:
#   supabase secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# Or in the Supabase dashboard: Project → Edge Functions → Secrets
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...          ← OpenAI (via llm-proxy)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...   ← Anthropic / Claude (via llm-proxy)

# ── Stripe ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dashboard: https://dashboard.stripe.com → Developers → API Keys
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# Server-side secrets — set via `supabase secrets set`:
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# ── Amadeus (live flight / hotel / activity search) ───────────────────────────
# Sign up: https://developers.amadeus.com → Create Self-Service App
# Set via `supabase secrets set`:
# AMADEUS_API_KEY=...
# AMADEUS_API_SECRET=...

# ── Foursquare (nearby POIs) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_FOURSQUARE_API_KEY=fsq...
EXPO_PUBLIC_FOURSQUARE_KEY=fsq...

# ── Google Calendar OAuth ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web)
# Enable: Google Calendar API
# Redirect URI: https://your-domain.com/auth/calendar/callback
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ── Microsoft Outlook OAuth ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://portal.azure.com → App registrations → New (SPA)
# Permissions: Microsoft Graph → Calendars.ReadWrite
VITE_MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── Buddy 3D avatar (Spline) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave blank to fall back to WebM video, then PNG
# VITE_SPLINE_SCENE_URL=https://prod.spline.design/your-scene.splinecode
# VITE_BUDDY_USE_SPLINE=0   ← force PNG mode

# ── Voice (ElevenLabs TTS — optional) ────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=...
